Third-party test vectors

The files below were written by others and are vendored as test data only; none
is compiled into any package. Each "Path:" line is a pattern over the
repository's files (a * stays inside one directory). internal/repository's
TestEveryVendoredCorpusHasANoticeRow holds this section to the tree: every file
under a testdata/vectors/ directory matches a row here or is one of the
repository's own bookkeeping files listed there, and every row matches a file.

Path: mls/testdata/vectors/*.json
    Source: github.com/mlswg/mls-implementations, commit
    cfd450286d1bfd9cd2519b95c80f9771f94a5b1a, test-vectors/, 16 files. Their
    content is upstream's; their lines end in CRLF where upstream's end in LF
    (mls/vectors_upstream_test.go holds each, line endings normalised, to its
    upstream blob).
    Terms: that repository publishes no license, so no license to these files
    is granted here. They are vendored as test data only, pending a license
    statement from the mlswg maintainers.

Path: mls/testdata/vectors/rfc/hpke-rfc9180-x25519.json
    Source: github.com/cfrg/draft-irtf-cfrg-hpke, commit
    b1f7cb0cdeab6906c61b3d6574e8bdfdbe1cd3fb, test-vectors.json, filtered to
    the two base-mode X25519 suites MLS registers; mls/interop/PINS.md gives
    the transform and both digests.
    Terms: Contributions to the IETF Standards Process under BCP 78, BCP 79
    and the IETF Trust Legal Provisions, as that repository's CONTRIBUTING.md
    states.

Path: messagegroup/testdata/vectors/rfc/xwing-draft10.json
    Source: github.com/dconnolly/draft-connolly-cfrg-xwing-kem, commit
    9b6ce9e614811dba8d46841052f3883cbc4c1a65, spec/test-vectors.json, whole
    and unmodified.
    Terms: Contributions to the IETF Standards Process under BCP 78, BCP 79
    and the IETF Trust Legal Provisions, as that repository's CONTRIBUTING.md
    states.
